<title>POLAND: Polish Paged wood firm opens 50 pct above issue.</title>
<headline>Polish Paged wood firm opens 50 pct above issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wood and furniture trader Paged SA started trading on the main market of the Warsaw Stock Exchange at 18 zlotys per share, 50 percent higher than its issue price of 12 zlotys.</p>
<p>Paged's two million shares were sold in a public offering last May and the issue was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
